=== PART 2. IS THE CLIFF EXACTLY 'THE ROWS APPEARED'? ===
If it is, then h_ml = 85 does not FIT WORSE than 84.99 -- it is SCORED ON
MORE DATA. Those are different defects and only one of them is about h_ml.

The identity being tested is EXACT, not approximate:
  Delta total  =  (the rows that appeared)  +  (the continuous drift)
where the drift is the sum of the 16 continuous streams' deltas plus the
prior's. There is nothing else in the objective, so the residual on that
identity must be ZERO to machine precision -- and a nonzero one would mean a
stream is moving that this file has not accounted for.

